WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
He is pregnant with twins

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
I let him give birth at that time

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
It is said that a boy is born for 100,000 yuan and a girl is born for 50,000 yuan.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
But I will file for divorce when I go home

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
I found out that my wife is also pregnant

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,580
I'll go back and comfort him

7
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:14,580
Another 30,000 yuan was given as nutrition allowance

8
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:15,580
Later

9
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:17,830
Others disappear

10
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:19,830
All the documents and clothes in the rental house are gone.

11
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:21,830
I thought he went back to his hometown

12
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:22,830
I'll tell you more

13
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:24,830
What happens next?

14
00:00:24,830 --> 00:00:27,760
After he took the money, he gave up on you

15
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:28,760
I had already decided to have an abortion

16
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:31,880
But just left the rental house

17
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:33,880
I bumped into your wife Luo Minwen

18
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:35,880
He took three or four people with him and beat him up.

19
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:37,880
Beat him until he miscarries

20
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:39,880
Heavy bleeding, Zi Gong removed

21
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,880
I will never be a mother again in this life.

22
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:43,880
If he couldn't accept it, he walked out of the hospital rooftop

23
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:44,880
Jumped down

24
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:46,880
Don't let him find me

25
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:47,880
Go find my wife

26
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:49,940
It was he who caused Fang Qiu to miscarry

27
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:51,940
What does it have to do with me

28
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:53,940
The ghost energy of Fang Qiu has skyrocketed.

29
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:54,940
You said this in front of him

30
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:56,940
Do you dare to repeat it again?

31
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:57,940
you owe him

32
00:00:57,940 --> 00:00:59,940
Money can't pay it off

33
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:00,940
I know it's wrong

34
00:01:00,940 --> 00:01:02,940
Is it okay if I'm wrong?

35
00:01:02,940 --> 00:01:04,390
You go first

36
00:01:04,390 --> 00:01:06,520
Wait until I call you
